## 🛠️ Hardware Components & Fabrication

### 1. V-Dipole Antenna (VHF Reception)
* **Design Purpose:** Selected as the primary baseline antenna due to its simple geometry, ease of fabrication, and rapid lab tunability.
* **Performance:** Evaluated in close-range controlled testing, achieving a clean audio reception with an observed **SNR of ~71 dB**. Tested across varying distances and off-axis orientations to characterize signal attenuation.
