### 3. Software-Defined Radio (SDR) Toolchain
The platform interfaces antennas with high-flexibility SDR hardware:
* **Pluto SDR**, **HackRF One**, and **USRP B200 Mini**.
* Tunable frequency range handling VHF observations around **135.6 MHz** and **137–138 MHz**.
